            "review_title": "Review at Banh Cuon Ba Hanh",
            "review_text": "Pincesdecrabe\nParis, France275 contributions\n1\nOne of the best experiences in Saigon\nJan 2020 • Couples\nSmall spot but amazingly clean and fresh tasty food\nFollow my advice: order a combination of rice rolls ( their specialty), papaye salad and lemongrass skewers with the cinnamon lean pork pies\nSmall size dishes, fresh ingredients it’s amazing.\nThey are kind and know how to communicate\nExcellent prices!!!\nWritten January 3, 2020",
