            "review_title": "Review at Banh Cuon Ba Hanh",
            "review_text": "Twee Fan\n1 contribution\n1\nFabulous Banh Cuon\nJan 2019 • Solo\nIt's difficult to recognize this restaurant as it's covered by Mint Cafe and Cinnamon Hotel.\nStopped here just for Egg coffee, and three of lovely girls there ( Inn, Chin, and Tina ) they all recommended me to try BANH CUON BA HANH. \nSo, I did try and it's yummyyyy. I only ordered 1 portion ( 55.000d) , this portion has 7 rolls, salad and Ice tea. It's really tasty,\n\nHighly recommend this place as well as Mint Cafe.\nThanks for taking care of me so well\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 27, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
