            "review_text": "Tuyết Trinh\n1 contribution\n1\nAmazing Rice Rolls\nJan 2019 • Solo\nBeen here just for Egg coffee of Mint Cafe and By the way, I tried the Banh Cuon Ba Hanh and it was delicious. I had the Food Memories with 6 rice rolls , 1 omelette with mushroom, lemongrass skewer and Soya Milk with only 79.000d (~ 3.5USD)\nI liked the taste of the food as it's not only tasty but also amazing!\nThe staffs are all very friendly with lovely smiles.\nWill be back for sure.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 15, 2019",
