            "review_title": "Review at Banh Cuon Ba Hanh",
            "review_text": "Khanh V\nAnaheim, California34 contributions\n1\nCute family-owned spot\nFeb 2018 • Solo\nI came here for lunch because I had been craving banh cuon and they did not disappoint. It's located on a side street away from the heavy traffic, but near the corner so easy to find. It's an indoor restaurant and could prob seat around 25 comfortably. From what I could tell, it was operated by a mom and son duo who were very friendly. I ordered the combo with banh cuon (minced pork), banh trung (scrambled egg), and soy milk for 59,000 vnd and was not disappointed.\nRead more\nWritten February 10, 2018",
